    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Impressive Four Bedroom Semi-Detached Residence\r\n\r\nA Superb Coastal Residence in a Sought-After Location\r\n\r\nKinsella Estates Gorey are delighted to present 13 Forest Park, Courtown, Co. Wexford, an impressive four-bedroom semi-detached residence situated within this popular and well-established coastal development.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 101 sq. m (1,087 sq. ft), this spacious property offers well-proportioned accommodation arranged over two floors. The layout provides excellent flexibility, with two bedrooms at ground-floor level and a further two bedrooms upstairs, making the property suitable for a variety of purchasers.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, kitchen, dining area, living room, master bedroom with ensuite, second bedroom, two further bedrooms on the first floor and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe property presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a permanent residence, holiday home or investment property in one of County Wexford's most popular coastal locations.\r\n\r\n\r\nCoastal Living at Forest Park\r\nForest Park enjoys a convenient setting close to the popular seaside village of Courtown, offering residents easy access to an excellent selection of local amenities and recreational facilities.\r\nCourtown and the surrounding coastline are renowned for their beaches, woodland walks and relaxed seaside atmosphere, making this an attractive location for both permanent residents and those looking for a coastal retreat.\r\nThe thriving town of Gorey is also within easy reach and offers an extensive selection of shops, boutiques, cafés, restaurants, schools and leisure facilities.\r\nFor commuters, the nearby M11 motorway provides excellent connectivity to Dublin and the wider motorway network, while Gorey also benefits from regular bus and rail services.\r\nWith its generous four-bedroom accommodation, convenient location and proximity to both Courtown and Gorey, 13 Forest Park represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a spacious home in a highly desirable coastal setting.\r\nEarly viewing is strongly recommended by the Auctioneer.\r\n\r\n\r\nBER: C, 102780236 \r\nEircode: Y25 NY61 \r\nHouse Type Y: (1,087 sq. ft) 101 sq. mt\r\nManagement Fees: 1,400, which includes, grass cutting, bins & electric gates\r\n\r\n\r\nACCOMMODATION\r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall:\r\nTiled Floor\r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.1m x 2.6m\r\nTiled Floor & Splash Back \r\n\r\nLiving Room/ Dining Area: 5.6m x 3.9m\r\nTiled Floor\r\nFeature Timber Fire Place\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.6m x 3.0m \r\nEnsuite Tiled Floor & Splash Back\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 2.6m x 3.5m\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.9m x 4.5m\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 2.6m x 5.7m\r\n\r\nShower Room: 2.2m x 1.7m\r\nFully Tiled \r\n\r\nBack Garden\r\nLow Maintenance Garden\r\nPatio Area\r\n\r\nServices:\r\nElectric Heating\r\nMains Sewerage \r\nMains Water"
